span class=\"date\">0330</span></div>\n<h2>預訓練才是主峰：智能本身就是最大的應用</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">模型公司是煉油廠，值錢的是化工廠和汽車公司；但今天最大的紅利是承接研究溢出的智能，而不是做產品拉動的應用。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">預訓練</span><span class=\"tag\">Agent</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"96. 和郎鹹朋聊，自動駕駛10年演進史、關鍵技術細節和特斯拉 BEV Transformer VLM MPI VLA 3DGS\" href=\"/podcast/p/2025-03-16-zhangxiaojun-l3-不是-l2-的延长-而是-l4-的先导/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fs3vQbZ-Jvi5gMg5QxPTmd1S83B5.png?imageMogr2/thumbnail/400x/format/webp\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">2:00:19</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0316</span></div>\n<h2>L3 不是 L2 的延長，而是 L4 的先導</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">理想自動駕駛團隊用端到端把 200 萬行代碼砍到 20 萬行，縱向控制第一次超過所有競品——不是人更聰明，是終於用做能力而不是做功能的方式做自動駕駛。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>3</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">自動駕駛</span><span class=\"tag\">端到端</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"94. 逐篇講解DeepSeek、Kimi、MiniMax注意力機制新論文——“硬件上的暴力美學” NSA (Native Sparse Attention) MoBA (Mixture of Block Attention) GQA (Group Query Attention) Lightning Attention trunkwise tensor core\" href=\"/podcast/p/2025-02-23-zhangxiaojun-deepseek-用暴力美学改架构-把-full-attention-全线压制了/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoAW9cKkGkjFJKrRxghi46_Mtt4-.png?imageMogr2/thumbnail/400x/format/webp\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">2:36:12</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0223</span></div>\n<h2>DeepSeek 用暴力美學改架構，把 Full Attention 全線壓制了</h2>\n<p cl